        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The purpose of the four tests just concluded, is to demonstrate the accuracy of the headstock spindle. The findings must show that any inaccuracy present in the spindle does not exceed the tolerances permitted in the several tests. If the tolerances are exceeded in one or more cases, the spindle should be reworked by grinding or machining, until it is capable of passing all four tests. The procedure to be followed in reworking the spindle is outside the scope of this book and will, therefore, not be discussed.",
